the common mode rejection ratio is 100, then the percentage difference in output voltage obtained for the two sets of input signals is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div><p>10%</p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div><p>15%</p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div><p>20%</p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div><p>25%</p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"/media/f8cf5861f6f24e522ed60c9898bc9b643ab4d39c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/f06498b1ae333e999d3ef9235f9fd15ac3b0bdfb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"single | Marks +2 / -0.66"},{"qnum":33,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>Test the operating region for the given MOSFET circuit with V<sub>Th</sub> = 0.4 V.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/bbccbb4fe6700913eedf13ef53d7dd6ee9425201.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div><p>ohmic</p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div><p>triode</p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div><p>current saturation</p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div><p>cutoff</p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"/media/fa31c16a567b3ad3de0e02866ed863f1e7f830b3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"single | Marks +1 / -0.33"}],"questionCount":33,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:09.227Z"}